    "type": "game",
    "name": "Watchword",
    "steam_appid": 2906730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watchword is a roguelike deck builder about playing words to beat increasingly difficult trials with rule-breaking synergies and combos.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/66c2441c776443a9cb39c0b62c1d6a9d.poster.avif?t=1754338724\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/66c2441c776443a9cb39c0b62c1d6a9d.webm?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/66c2441c776443a9cb39c0b62c1d6a9d.mp4?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good vocabulary will certainly help, but it will mostly take careful planning and strategy to beat each trial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invent crazy new words and use special symbols to play a board that scores massively! Fill your bag and customize your collection of pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/24ebdaffd99343fc35a1c335233b931b.poster.avif?t=1754338724\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/24ebdaffd99343fc35a1c335233b931b.webm?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purchase books to ramp up your point scoring.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each book has a unique power that can help (or potentially hinder) depending on what pieces you use. Some books completely change the rules of the game. Explore, and discover  clever combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/d72c11dd5ca66f6241d13bbcd123286f.avif?t=1754338724\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endlessly re-playable no two runs are the same. Chase a new build, unlock more difficult trials, and find hidden unlockables. After each trial, visit the Forum where you'll be able to upgrade your run, buy new items, and prepare for your next trial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/0b02e902ff7b650ce3b0a4a415ed7afd.poster.avif?t=1754338724\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/0b02e902ff7b650ce3b0a4a415ed7afd.webm?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/0b02e902ff7b650ce3b0a4a415ed7afd.mp4?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>120+ Unique book relics</strong>: No two powers are the same. Add infinite repeat letters to words with &quot;The Good Book&quot; or focus on using new words with &quot;Thesaurus&quot;. Each book has a unique strength that combos well with other books.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of piece variations:</strong>\u00a0Every letter in the alphabet + custom bigrams (Two-letter tiles like QU, CH, or EE). You can even find mysterious Symbol tiles like &quot;!&quot;, &quot;?&quot; or &quot;&amp;&quot; that have strange abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100,000+ Possible Watchwords:</strong> Try to spell a special word to expand the size of your board to make room for more powerful words in future trials.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Watchguards</strong>: Each watchguard has a unique strategy to make their trial more difficult. Watch your wallet against the Greedy watchguard and make sure you plan ahead for the Patient Watchguard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+  run upgrades:</strong> Permanently upgrade your draws, discards, hand size, and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made-Up Words:</strong> Watchword is the only word game where you can make up words to fit your strategy. Find forbidden books that completely blow the dictionary wide open.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check your stats and shoot for new high scores:</strong>\u00a0Go infinite and see your high scores go into the hundred of billions of points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability:</strong>\u00a0Watch minutes become hours as you try to fit just <i>one</i> more word into your board and beat just<i> one</i>\u00a0more run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watchword is a roguelike deck builder about playing words to beat increasingly difficult trials with rule-breaking synergies and combos.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/66c2441c776443a9cb39c0b62c1d6a9d.poster.avif?t=1754338724\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/66c2441c776443a9cb39c0b62c1d6a9d.webm?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/66c2441c776443a9cb39c0b62c1d6a9d.mp4?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good vocabulary will certainly help, but it will mostly take careful planning and strategy to beat each trial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invent crazy new words and use special symbols to play a board that scores massively! Fill your bag and customize your collection of pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/24ebdaffd99343fc35a1c335233b931b.poster.avif?t=1754338724\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/24ebdaffd99343fc35a1c335233b931b.webm?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purchase books to ramp up your point scoring.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each book has a unique power that can help (or potentially hinder) depending on what pieces you use. Some books completely change the rules of the game. Explore, and discover  clever combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/d72c11dd5ca66f6241d13bbcd123286f.avif?t=1754338724\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endlessly re-playable no two runs are the same. Chase a new build, unlock more difficult trials, and find hidden unlockables. After each trial, visit the Forum where you'll be able to upgrade your run, buy new items, and prepare for your next trial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/0b02e902ff7b650ce3b0a4a415ed7afd.poster.avif?t=1754338724\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/0b02e902ff7b650ce3b0a4a415ed7afd.webm?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906730/extras/0b02e902ff7b650ce3b0a4a415ed7afd.mp4?t=1754338724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>120+ Unique book relics</strong>: No two powers are the same. Add infinite repeat letters to words with &quot;The Good Book&quot; or focus on using new words with &quot;Thesaurus&quot;. Each book has a unique strength that combos well with other books.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of piece variations:</strong>\u00a0Every letter in the alphabet + custom bigrams (Two-letter tiles like QU, CH, or EE). You can even find mysterious Symbol tiles like &quot;!&quot;, &quot;?&quot; or &quot;&amp;&quot; that have strange abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100,000+ Possible Watchwords:</strong> Try to spell a special word to expand the size of your board to make room for more powerful words in future trials.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Watchguards</strong>: Each watchguard has a unique strategy to make their trial more difficult. Watch your wallet against the Greedy watchguard and make sure you plan ahead for the Patient Watchguard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+  run upgrades:</strong> Permanently upgrade your draws, discards, hand size, and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made-Up Words:</strong> Watchword is the only word game where you can make up words to fit your strategy. Find forbidden books that completely blow the dictionary wide open.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check your stats and shoot for new high scores:</strong>\u00a0Go infinite and see your high scores go into the hundred of billions of points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability:</strong>\u00a0Watch minutes become hours as you try to fit just <i>one</i> more word into your board and beat just<i> one</i>\u00a0more run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Watchword is the anagram roguelike. Strategically spell real and made-up words while using magical rule-bending books to score massively satisfying combos. Build your deck of letter tiles and find synergies in this endlessly re-playable twist on classic word games.",
